                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Gee this is a tough one. \n\nPrice - 20mins for $20us is a bit steep. Then I suppose you got to expect that when companies are aiming at a small target. Still not worth it in my eyes.\n\nReplay - zero to maybe.\n\nFor the vive this is greatly cut back for the psvr. It really made me think how lucky I am to own a vive. \n\nAnyway the review - if you get motion sickness steer clear as there are a few flying with no controlling movement moments. There is 4 areas that you sit and do very small tasks to move the story on. Example throw big potatoes into the big bucket and small potatoes in the small bucket. Yep that's how exciting this experience is. Besides that you watch quick 5sec clips that are displayed like big screen beta all over the place to make it seem exciting I suppose\n\nI give this the thumbs down. Didn't go much on the movie and I think the movie is better than this!",
